<div class="center">
  <h1>Upload files</h1>
  <p>Pick one or more files and they will be posted into the room you ran <code>/upload</code> in,
     together as one post where the room's platform supports it. This page works once, and stops
     working at <%= h(format_time(@expires_at)) %>.</p>
  <form method="post" action="<%= h(request.script_name) %>/u/<%= h(@token) %>" enctype="multipart/form-data">
    <p><input type="file" name="file[]" multiple required></p>
    <p><button type="submit">Upload</button></p>
  </form>
  <p>A file over <%= h(@max_bytes / (1024 * 1024)) %> MB is refused, and so is a selection of more
     than <%= h(@max_batch_files) %> files or over <%= h(@max_batch_bytes / (1024 * 1024)) %> MB
     together. Whoever holds a download link can open the file, so treat every link as the file
     itself.</p>
</div>
